  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> , </span>has released the result for the 4 Years B.Sc. Pre Agriculture Test (PAT) Course 2026. Applications for the MPESB PAT Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 24 March 2026 to 07 April 2026. The written examination is going to be conducted from 08 May 2026. Candidates who appeared in this examination can download their MPESB PAT Result 2026 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Madhya Pradesh Employee Selection Board MPESB</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">MPESB PAT Result 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>07 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>07 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date : <strong>12 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>08 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>30 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>12 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>18 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, Candidates :<strong> Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC, SC, ST :<strong> Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Portal Charge Extra : <strong>Rs. 60/- Extra</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPESB Pre Agriculture Test PAT Online Form 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">No Age Limit</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per MPESB Pre Agriculture Test PAT Online Form Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPESB Pre Agriculture Test PAT Online Form 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course Duration</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. (Owners) AG</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. (Owners) Horticulture</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. (Owners) Forestry</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Tech (AG Engineering)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04 Years</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>MPESB Pre Agriculture Test PAT Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5801%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.4199%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5801%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. (Owners) AG</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.4199%;\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed 10+2 (Intermediate) with Science stream, including subjects like Math, Biology, or Forestry, or must have completed 10+2 with Agriculture.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5801%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. (Owners) Horticulture</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5801%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. (Owners) Forestry</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.4199%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed 10+2 (Intermediate) with a Science stream and subjects such as Math, Biology, or Forestry.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5801%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Tech (AG Engineering)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.4199%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed 10+2 (Intermediate) with Physics, Chemistry, Math, and English as subjects.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download MPESB PAT Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open the Download Result link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, a new page will be opened in which candidates have to provide Roll Number / Application Number &amp; DOB.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to download the result &amp; save the pdf file for the future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can download the result also from the official website of MPESB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPESB Pre Agriculture Test PAT Online Form 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Merit List</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow